      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.58,
          "end": 3.75,
          "en": "Instructor: In the last lecture we had",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.75,
          "end": 5.46,
          "en": "a look at string interpolation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.46,
          "end": 9.24,
          "en": "which is a great tool for outputting data in a template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.24,
          "end": 11.67,
          "en": "Now when I have a look at property binding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.67,
          "end": 14.16,
          "en": "Now one important formation right away,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.16,
          "end": 16.89,
          "en": "there are a lot of times where you can",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.89,
          "end": 20.55,
          "en": "either use property binding or string interpolation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.55,
          "end": 22.95,
          "en": "and I will show what I mean in a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.95,
          "end": 25.17,
          "en": "Let's go to our servers component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.17,
          "end": 27.27,
          "en": "where we manage all the servers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.27,
          "end": 30.51,
          "en": "And I want to allow the user to add new servers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.51,
          "end": 32.88,
          "en": "at least soon, I want to allow that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.88,
          "end": 36.9,
          "en": "So we will need a button where I say add server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.9,
          "end": 39.72,
          "en": "on it and I would just add some CSS classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.72,
          "end": 42.69,
          "en": "button and button primary to make this button look nice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.69,
          "end": 46.47,
          "en": "This is all using normal bootstrap CSS classes, though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.47,
          "end": 48.21,
          "en": "nothing to do with Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.21,
          "end": 51.78,
          "en": "And to reflect this change in my service component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.78,
          "end": 54.3,
          "en": "I also want to comment out the inline template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.3,
          "end": 55.8,
          "en": "and point to the external template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.8,
          "end": 59.043,
          "en": "Again. So template URL should point",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.043,
          "end": 64.043,
          "en": "to my servers component dot html file like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.27,
          "end": 69.99,
          "en": "So now with this, if I save this we see that button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.99,
          "end": 71.82,
          "en": "right now it does make any sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.82,
          "end": 73.83,
          "en": "that I'm able to click this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.83,
          "end": 75.3,
          "en": "because it doesn't do anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.3,
          "end": 78.69,
          "en": "We haven't learned to react to a button click yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.69,
          "end": 82.8,
          "en": "So I will add a new property in my TypeScript code here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.8,
          "end": 87.8,
          "en": "which I'll name, allow new server and set it to false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.84,
          "end": 91.28999999999999,
          "en": "So now this is all in our property holding a bullion value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.28999999999999,
          "end": 92.64,
          "en": "So true or false in this case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.64,
          "end": 94.8,
          "en": "False because I don't want to allow the user to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.8,
          "end": 96.81,
          "en": "create a new server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 96.81,
          "end": 99.45,
          "en": "And you could again imagine that there's a somehow",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 99.45,
          "end": 100.8,
          "en": "derived dynamically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 100.8,
          "end": 104.03999999999999,
          "en": "We will soon work with some dynamic data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.03999999999999,
          "end": 108.50999999999999,
          "en": "So in the HTML file here, I now want to disable the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 108.50999999999999,
          "end": 109.8,
          "en": "And as you probably know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 109.8,
          "end": 113.13,
          "en": "there is a disabled attribute you can add, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 113.13,
          "end": 115.5,
          "en": "If we now save this, the button's disabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.5,
          "end": 116.67,
          "en": "I can't click it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 116.67,
          "end": 119.88,
          "en": "That's nice, but that's hard coded into html.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 119.88,
          "end": 124.38,
          "en": "Now maybe this allowing new server code here changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 124.38,
          "end": 128.07,
          "en": "however, maybe it's not set to this all the time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 128.07,
          "end": 130.08,
          "en": "So then we wouldn't be able to react to this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 130.08,
          "end": 132.42,
          "en": "And I can actually demonstrate this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 132.42,
          "end": 134.07,
          "en": "but for now in the constructor,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 134.07,
          "end": 136.71,
          "en": "which is simply a method executor at the point of time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 136.71,
          "end": 139.74,
          "en": "this component is created by angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 139.74,
          "end": 144.3,
          "en": "By there, calling set time out a normal JavaScript function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 144.3,
          "end": 147.54,
          "en": "And here I define after which period of time or",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 147.54,
          "end": 149.85,
          "en": "after how many milliseconds something should happen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 149.85,
          "end": 152.85,
          "en": "So after 2000 milliseconds, which are two seconds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 152.85,
          "end": 154.95,
          "en": "I want to execute a function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 154.95,
          "end": 158.28,
          "en": "And here I'm using a ES6 arrow function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 158.28,
          "end": 160.23,
          "en": "This syntax might look strange.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 160.23,
          "end": 164.31,
          "en": "It's almost the same as function, like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 164.31,
          "end": 166.29,
          "en": "with the diff some difference when it comes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 166.29,
          "end": 168.32999999999998,
          "en": "to handling the disk keyword.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 168.32999999999998,
          "end": 170.67000000000002,
          "en": "But in the end here, you pass the arguments and here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 170.67000000000002,
          "end": 172.44,
          "en": "you have the function body.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 172.44,
          "end": 176.49,
          "en": "More importantly, in here I can set, allow a new server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 176.49,
          "end": 178.71,
          "en": "And now this would not work in the average syntax",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 178.71,
          "end": 180.6,
          "en": "because this would then be referring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 180.6,
          "end": 183.21,
          "en": "to something else, can set it to true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 183.21,
          "end": 185.31,
          "en": "So after two seconds, this will be switched to true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 185.31,
          "end": 187.26,
          "en": "And since we hard coded this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 187.26,
          "end": 189.99,
          "en": "of course this doesn't affect our button here at all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 189.99,
          "end": 191.97,
          "en": "It stays disabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 191.97,
          "end": 195.84,
          "en": "So I want to bind it to allow a new server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 195.84,
          "end": 199.26,
          "en": "So now to make this disabled functionality dynamic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 199.26,
          "end": 203.25,
          "en": "we can bind to it by enclosing it in square brackets.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 203.25,
          "end": 205.82999999999998,
          "en": "Square brackets indicate to angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 205.82999999999998,
          "end": 207.78,
          "en": "that we're using property binding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 207.78,
          "end": 211.62,
          "en": "that we want to dynamically bind some property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 211.62,
          "end": 214.71,
          "en": "and disabled the HTML attribute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 214.71,
          "end": 219.6,
          "en": "In the end, a normal HTML only sets a specific property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 219.6,
          "end": 222.3,
          "en": "on the underlying dom element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 222.3,
          "end": 226.02,
          "en": "You might know that each HTML element you use is parsed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 226.02,
          "end": 228.45,
          "en": "by the browser and kind of translate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 228.45,
          "end": 231.32999999999998,
          "en": "into an element on the document object model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 231.32999999999998,
          "end": 234.12,
          "en": "This is totally unrelated to angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 234.12,
          "end": 237.93,
          "en": "and therefore we have a element in this dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 237.93,
          "end": 240.6,
          "en": "And this element has a couple of properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 240.6,
          "end": 242.25,
          "en": "A lot of these can't even be set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 242.25,
          "end": 245.58,
          "en": "through attributes on the HTML element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 245.58,
          "end": 248.46,
          "en": "Well, one of the properties is the disabled property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 248.46,
          "end": 251.22,
          "en": "and you can set it through the disabled attribute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 251.22,
          "end": 254.49,
          "en": "But here we're not using the disabled attribute anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 254.49,
          "end": 258.45,
          "en": "With the square brackets, we are directly binding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 258.45,
          "end": 263.45,
          "en": "to this native disabled property this HTM element has.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 264.51,
          "end": 267,
          "en": "So now we can set this equal to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 267,
          "end": 269.58,
          "en": "and now between quotation marks here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 269.58,
          "end": 274.58,
          "en": "an expression which for this property resolves to a bullion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 274.65,
          "end": 278.37,
          "en": "But for our properties and our type might be required",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 278.37,
          "end": 280.95,
          "en": "because again, you can bind to a lot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 280.95,
          "end": 285.95,
          "en": "of properties basically to all the HTML element properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 286.11,
          "end": 287.61,
          "en": "We'll soon learn that there are",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 287.61,
          "end": 290.19,
          "en": "also other properties you can bind to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 290.19,
          "end": 291.75,
          "en": "So for now, I can simply pass",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 291.75,
          "end": 294.63,
          "en": "allow new server here, my property name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 294.63,
          "end": 298.26,
          "en": "because this will resolve to true or false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 298.26,
          "end": 301.5,
          "en": "exactly the value the disabled property needs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 301.5,
          "end": 302.76,
          "en": "because it has to decide",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 302.76,
          "end": 304.92,
          "en": "whether it should be disabled or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 304.92,
          "end": 308.91,
          "en": "So now with that, if we rewards this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 308.91,
          "end": 311.4,
          "en": "so by adding an exclamation mark, we made sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 311.4,
          "end": 314.07,
          "en": "that this is only disabled if this is false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 314.07,
          "end": 317.43,
          "en": "So if we, if allow new server is not true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 317.43,
          "end": 320.07,
          "en": "otherwise we would do exactly the opposite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 320.07,
          "end": 321.81,
          "en": "So now with the exclamation mark,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 321.81,
          "end": 324.33,
          "en": "if we go back to the app you see it's disabled,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 324.33,
          "end": 326.73,
          "en": "but after two seconds, let me reload this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 326.73,
          "end": 328.41,
          "en": "it becomes enabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 328.41,
          "end": 332.04,
          "en": "Because now we're binding to this disabled property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 332.04,
          "end": 334.29,
          "en": "this native element property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 334.29,
          "end": 338.34000000000003,
          "en": "We're binding this to our own TypeScript property here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 338.34000000000003,
          "end": 341.88,
          "en": "And the convenient thing is, and this is what angler is all",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 341.88,
          "end": 345.03,
          "en": "about, that this will update dynamically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 345.03,
          "end": 348.36,
          "en": "So once allow new server changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 348.36,
          "end": 349.98,
          "en": "this is changed in the dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 349.98,
          "end": 352.23,
          "en": "So now the button gets enabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 352.23,
          "end": 354.84000000000003,
          "en": "One of the main reasons why you use angular,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 354.84000000000003,
          "end": 356.76,
          "en": "it makes very easy for you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 356.76,
          "end": 360.75,
          "en": "to interact with your dom to change some things there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 360.75,
          "end": 363.72,
          "en": "at run time like we do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 363.72,
          "end": 366,
          "en": "That is property binding in place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 366,
          "end": 368.13,
          "en": "Now, as I mentioned, besides binding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 368.13,
          "end": 371.64,
          "en": "to HTML element properties like we do here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 371.64,
          "end": 373.65,
          "en": "you can also bind to our properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 373.65,
          "end": 376.59,
          "en": "for example of directives, something we haven't learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 376.59,
          "end": 378.66,
          "en": "about yet and your own components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 378.66,
          "end": 381,
          "en": "Something I will also show you later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 381,
          "end": 383.76,
          "en": "So there's this property binding before moving",
